      "side": 1,
      "message": "Freezing interfaces is automated as of last year. We don\u0027t want to make it into a whole big thing.\n\nWe may need a flag to block an interface from being frozen (or manually remove interfaces), but we don\u0027t want to have to do any work here. One auto-generated topic to move the release up. If we\u0027re doing more effort than that, we should fix it :)",
