        "id": 1120458
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-06T00:10:54Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We can make this one of the first steps and make it an optional finalization step (e.g. if we need it we can do something like b/318883690). So if we have a way to read what is the latest compat matrix version then it can say:\n\n\n\"if the current compat matrix \u003e\u003d FINAL_COMPATIBILITY_MATRIX_LEVEL: continue\"\n\nor similar - that way we have the option to freeze the compat matrix manually, but we still automatically test freezing the compat matrix\n\n\nNote automation is important so that we automatically test that we can freeze it and things still build/boot/work after frozen, even when we\u0027re not ready to freeze it. We don\u0027t want late surprises.",
      "parentUuid": "da587958_b4fe4e35",
